class Ring:public QWidget{int a=0;public:Ring(){setFixedSize(142,142);auto*t=new QTimer(this);connect(t,&QTimer::timeout,this,[this]{a=(a+5)%360;update();});t->start(16);}protected:void paintEvent(QPaintEvent*)override{QPainter p(this);p.setRenderHint(QPainter::Antialiasing);QPointF c(width()/2.,height()/2.);p.setPen(QPen(QColor(216,180,106,55),2));p.drawEllipse(c,61,61);p.save();p.translate(c);p.rotate(a);for(int i=0;i<24;i++){p.setPen(QPen(QColor(224,190,116,25+i*9),3,Qt::SolidLine,Qt::RoundCap));p.drawLine(0,-68,0,-60);p.rotate(15);}p.restore();p.setPen(QPen(QColor("#d8b46a"),2));p.setBrush(QColor("#11131b"));p.drawEllipse(c,49,49);}};
